  "method": "Matched the operator’s address to the county address point and tax lot ID. Reprojected the county and agency GeoJSON geometries from WGS 84 (EPSG:4326) to WGS 84 / UTM zone 10N (EPSG:32610). Intersected the effective FEMA zone polygons with the full county tax lot. Divided the union of the intersecting SFHA areas by tax lot area. Checked the state susceptibility polygon separately. Queried the agency layers at the address point independently.",
